{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Finding three &quot;secrets&quot; (hidden items) hidden somewhere in a NORMAL stage will bring you to the HARD mode, a higher difficulty level. In addition, new characters and skills can be unlocked by clearing stages and meeting certain conditions. NINPUCHI! In the demo version, you can enjoy up to 6 playable characters and 3 stages including hidden elements. The finished product will offer at least 18 playable characters and more than 10 various stages. (in stage of development as of 2025.3)</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ninpuchi! is a roguelike action game. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a 3-player party strategy, you can freely build your own characters and begin your own adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Basic rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440560/extras/Timeline-1.gif?t=1745444813\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat monsters and defeat bosses within the time limit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between 3-person parties and strategically attack. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character by acquiring random skills at level-up.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Character development elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440560/extras/menu2.gif?t=1745444813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the &quot;store,&quot; coins earned in stages are used to raise the basic abilities common to all characters. By trying difficult stages over and over again, both the characters and the players themselves can grow and clear the stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Unlock element</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440560/extras/hard2.gif?t=1745444813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding three &quot;secrets&quot; (hidden items) hidden somewhere in the NORMAL stages will bring you to the HARD mode, which is a higher difficulty level. New characters and skills can be unlocked by clearing stages and meeting certain conditions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440560?t=1745444813","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440560/bceca53d43116fb869495e763a5822f4f217ae30/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745444813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440560/2453bdfe1f6e71882681650660d8443334865743/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745444813","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440560/2453bdfe1f6e71882681650660d8443334865743/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745444813","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Finding three &quot;secrets&quot; (hidden items) hidden somewhere in a NORMAL stage will bring you to the HARD mode, a higher difficulty level. In addition, new characters and skills can be unlocked by clearing stages and meeting certain conditions. NINPUCHI! In the demo version, you can enjoy up to 6 playable characters and 3 stages including hidden elements. The finished product will offer at least 18 playable characters and more than 10 various stages. (in stage of development as of 2025.3)</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ninpuchi! is a roguelike action game. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a 3-player party strategy, you can freely build your own characters and begin your own adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Basic rule</strong></h2><p class=\"